{"source": {"title": "静夜思", "author": "李白", "text": "床前明月光，疑是地上霜。
举头望明月，低头思故乡。"}, "translation": "Before my bed a pool of light,
I wonder: can it be frost on the ground?
I raise my head to gaze at the bright moon;
I lower my head, and think of my old home."}

{"source": {"title": "静夜思", "author": "李白", "text": "床前明月光，疑是地上霜。
举头望明月，低头思故乡。"}, "translation": "Before my bed a pool of light—
I take it to be frost on the ground.
Looking up, I gaze at the bright moon;
Bowing my head, I think of home."}

