随意春芳歇，王孙自可留。"}, "translation": "Autumn Evening in the Mountain

New-washed, the empty mountain brims with air;
The evening deepens, autumn everywhere.
The bright moon glows through gaps among the pines;
A clear spring ripples over stony lines.
