{"source": {"title": "黄鹤楼送孟浩然之广陵", "author": "李白", "text": "故人西辞黄鹤楼，烟花三月下扬州。
孤帆远影碧空尽，唯见长江天际流。"}, "translation": "Seeing Meng Haoran Off at Yellow Crane Tower to Guangling (Yangzhou)

My old friend bids farewell to the west at Yellow Crane Tower,
Amid the misty blooms of March, he sails down to Yangzhou.
His lone sail, a distant shadow, vanishes into the blue;
I see only the Yangtze flowing to the edge of the sky."}

