{"source": {"title": "浣溪沙·一曲新词酒一杯", "author": "晏殊", "text": "一曲新词酒一杯，去年天气旧亭台。夕阳西下几时回？
无可奈何花落去，似曾相识燕归来。小园香径独徘徊。"}, "translation": "A new song, a cup of wine;
the weather of last year, the old pavilion.
The setting sun descends westward — when will it return?

Helplessly flowers fall and drift away;
as if familiar swallows return.
The small garden's fragrant path — alone I wander."}

{"source": {"title": "浣溪沙·一曲新词酒一杯", "author": "晏殊", "text": "一曲新词酒一杯，去年天气旧亭台。夕阳西下几时回？
无可奈何花落去，似曾相识燕归来。小园香径独徘徊。"}, "translation": "A tune newly sung, a cup of wine anew;
Last year's weather, the old pavilion still.
The sun sets west — will it ever return to view?

Fain as I may, the blossoms fall away;
Like old acquaintances, the swallows come again.
Along the fragrant path of the small garden, alone I stray."}

{"source": {"title": "静夜思", "author": "李白", "text": "床前明月光，疑是地上霜。
举头望明月，低头思故乡。"}, "translation": "Before my bed the bright moonlight gleams;  
I mistake it for frost on the ground.  
I raise my head to gaze at the bright moon;  
I lower it and think of my hometown."}

{"source": {"title": "静夜思", "author": "李白", "text": "床前明月光，疑是地上霜。
举头望明月，低头思故乡。"}, "translation": "Before my bed, a pool of light—
Is it hoarfrost on the ground?
Looking up, I see the moon so bright;
Bowing, I'm drowned in homesickness."}

{"source": {"title": "静夜思", "author": "李白", "text": "床前明月光，疑是地上霜。
举头望明月，低头思故乡。"}, "translation": "**Quiet Night Thought**

Moonlight glows before my bed—
I wonder if it is the frost.
I raise my head to gaze upon the bright moon;
I lower my head and think of home."}

{"source": {"title": "静夜思", "author": "李白", "text": "床前明月光，疑是地上霜。
举头望明月，低头思故乡。"}, "translation": "Before my bed the bright moonlight—
I take it for frost upon the ground.
Raising my head, I gaze at the bright moon;
Lowering my head, I think of my distant home."}

{"source": {"title": "静夜思", "author": "李白", "text": "床前明月光，疑是地上霜。
举头望明月，低头思故乡。"}, "translation": "Before my bed, bright moonlight glows—
I take it for frost on the ground.
