{"source": {"title": "送元二使安西", "author": "王维", "text": "渭城朝雨浥轻尘，客舍青青柳色新。
劝君更尽一杯酒，西出阳关无故人。"}, "translation": "**Seeing Off Yuan Er on His Mission to Anxi**

Morning rain in Weicheng wets the drifting dust;
The inn's fresh willows gleam with spring's green hue.
I urge you, friend, to drain another cup of wine—
West of Yangguan Pass, no old friends wait for you."}

{"source": {"title": "送元二使安西", "author": "王维", "text": "渭城朝雨浥轻尘，客舍青青柳色新。
劝君更尽一杯酒，西出阳关无故人。"}, "translation": "Morning rain has settled the light dust by the Wei River;  
The willows by the tavern gleam in fresh green.  
I urge you to drain one more cup of wine—  
West of Yang Pass, there will be no old friends."}

{"source": {"title": "鹿柴", "author": "王维", "text": "空山不见人，但闻人语响。
返景入深林，复照青苔上。"}, "translation": "On the empty mountain, no one is seen;  
Yet human voices are heard echoing.  
Slanting sunlight pierces the deep wood  
And shines again upon the green moss."}

{"source": {"title": "静夜思", "author": "李白", "text": "床前明月光，疑是地上霜。
举头望明月，低头思故乡。"}, "translation": "Before my bed a pool of light,
I take it for the frost upon the ground.
Raising my head, I gaze on the bright moon;
