{"source": {"title": "送元二使安西", "author": "王维", "text": "渭城朝雨浥轻尘，客舍青青柳色新。
劝君更尽一杯酒，西出阳关无故人。"}, "translation": "Morning rain in Wei City
has laid the drifting dust with dew;
the inn stands green, the willows gleam
