{"source": {"title": "鹿柴", "author": "王维", "text": "空山不见人，但闻人语响。
返景入深林，复照青苔上。"}, "translation": "Deer Enclosure

No one is seen on the empty mountain;
Only voices echo through the air.
Reflected light slips into the deep woods,
