{"source": {"title": "春望", "author": "杜甫", "text": "国破山河在，城春草木深。
感时花溅泪，恨别鸟惊心。
烽火连三月，家书抵万金。
白头搔更短，浑欲不胜簪。"}, "translation": "Broken is the nation, yet mountains and rivers stand;  
Spring in the city, grass and trees grow deep.  
Grieved by the times, flowers weep;  
Hating parting, birds startle the heart.  
